{"version":1,"content":"<p>加拿大天王The Weeknd假啟德體育園主場館舉行共4場《The Weeknd：After Hours Til Dawn Tour》世界巡迴演唱會香港站，已於日前圓滿落幕。</p><p>4場演出累計吸引約20萬人次入場，創今年首位在啟德主場館舉行個人演唱會男歌手最高記錄。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:00:52.324243+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:23:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:22.708358+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:58:21.598837+00:00","content_hash":"c2780026f9ded0638d6ce381578ff2010a924d33b88464dbc636268c61f34aa8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}